msgid "Wayland/X11"
msgstr "Wayland/X11"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

msgid ""
"One of the important components of any operating system is its display "
"server. Windows and macOS only provide one option, Linux however has two, "
"X11 and Wayland."
msgstr ""
"任何操作系统的一个重要组成部分是其显示服务器（display server）。Windows 和 "
"macOS 仅提供一种选项，然而 Linux 却有两种，即 X11 和 Wayland。"

msgid ""
"X11 is an older standard and is currently being gradually phased out by the "
"majority of linux distributions in favor of supporting Wayland, which has "
"been developed as a replacement. Applications running on X11 can still work "
"when a distribution is using Wayland thanks to a compatibility layer known "
"as Xwayland."
msgstr ""
"X11 是一个较旧的标准，目前大多数 Linux 发行版正逐渐弃用它，转而支持作为其替代"
"品开发的 Wayland。得益于一个名为 Xwayland 的兼容层，即使发行版使用 Wayland，"
"原本运行在 X11 上的应用程序依然可以正常工作。"

msgid ""
"Godot's support is still a work in progress, so for now X11 remains the "
"default setting for game projects, that will likely change in a future "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Godot 对 Wayland 的支持仍在开发完善中，因此目前 X11 依然是游戏项目的默认设"
"置，但这很可能在未来的版本中发生改变。"

msgid "When to use Wayland"
msgstr "Wayland 的适用场景"

msgid ""
"If you're an engine developer who wants to help improve support, or if you "
"think Xwayland might be causing visual glitches in your exported project for "
"whatever reason, then we would recommend using Wayland. But outside of that "
"it's recommended to stick with X11 for now. It's important to note that "
"while X11 applications can run on Wayland, the reverse is not true."
msgstr ""
"如果你是希望帮助改进支持的引擎开发人员，或者你认为 Xwayland 可能因某些原因导"
"致导出的项目出现视觉瑕疵，那么我们建议你使用 Wayland。但除此之外，目前仍建议"
"坚持使用 X11。需要注意的是，虽然 X11 应用程序可以在 Wayland 上运行，但反过来"
"却不成立。"

msgid ""
"As of January 2026 most popular distributions are using Wayland by default, "
"including, but not limited to, the following:"
msgstr ""
"截至 2026 年 1 月，大多数主流的 Linux 发行版已默认使用 Wayland，包括但不限于"
"以下发行版："

msgid "SteamOS"
msgstr "SteamOS"

msgid "Bazzite"
msgstr "Bazzite"

msgid "CachyOS"
msgstr "CachyOS"

msgid "Fedora"
msgstr "Fedora"

msgid "Fedora Silverblue"
msgstr "Fedora Silverblue"

msgid "Ubuntu"
msgstr "Ubuntu"

msgid "OpenSuse"
msgstr "OpenSuse"

msgid ""
"Keep in mind that for some distributions, like Ubuntu, users may have "
"changed the display server to X11 manually themselves."
msgstr ""
"需要注意的是，对于某些发行版（如 Ubuntu），用户可能已经手动将其显示服务器改为"
"了 X11。"

msgid "Changing the setting"
msgstr "更改设置"

msgid ""
"To change your display server to Wayland click on :menu:`Project > project "
"settings`, from here, go to :button:`Display Server` and change "
"the :button:`driver.linuxbsd` option to ``wayland``."
msgstr ""
"要将你的显示服务器更改为 Wayland，请单击 :menu:`Project > project settings`，"
"然后转到 :button:`Display Server`，并将 :button:`driver.linuxbsd` 选项更改为 "
"``wayland``。"

msgid "Disabling Libdecor loading"
msgstr "禁用 Libdecor 的加载"

